{"ticker":{"symbol":"SSRM","name":"SSR Mining Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":28.38,"change_pct":0.016475644699140313,"market_cap":5663627264.0,"pe":9.009523,"pb":1.7376927,"dividend_yield":0.0010570824524312897,"week52_low":19.69,"week52_high":39.44,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Gold","country":"United States","city":"Denver","employees":2900,"website":"https://www.ssrmining.com","business_summary":"SSR Mining Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the acquisition, exploration, and development of precious metal resource properties in the United States, Türkiye, Canada, and Argentina. The company explores for gold doré, copper, silver, lead, and zinc deposits. It holds interests in the Çöpler located in Erzincan province, Turkey; the Marigold situated in Nevada, the United States; the Seabee located in Saskatchewan, Canada; and the Puna situated in Jujuy province, Argentina. The company was formerly known as Silver Standard Resources Inc. and changed its name to SSR Mining Inc. in August 2017. SSR Mining Inc. was incorporated in 1946 and is based in Denver, Colorado.","business_summary_ko":"SSR Mining Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국, 터키, 캐나다 및 아르헨티나에서 귀금속 자원 자산의 획득, 탐사 및 개발에 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 금도레, 구리, 은, 납 및 아연 매장지를 탐색합니다. 터키 Erzincan 지방에 위치한 Çöpler에 지분을 보유하고 있습니다. 미국 네바다주에 위치한 메리골드; 캐나다 서스캐처원에 위치한 Seabee; 아르헨티나 후후이(Jujuy) 지방에 위치한 푸나(Puna). 이 회사는 이전에 Silver Standard Resources Inc.로 알려졌으며 2017년 8월에 SSR Mining Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. SSR Mining Inc.는 1946년에 설립되었으며 콜로라도주 덴버에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":2117961770.0,"rev_lo":2114585300.0,"rev_hi":2122300000.0,"rev_g":0.2997,"n":5,"eps":3.74923,"eps_lo":3.71,"eps_hi":3.79614,"eps_g":0.8653},{"period":"2027","rev":2295994560.0,"rev_lo":2080211940.0,"rev_hi":2626000000.0,"rev_g":0.0841,"n":5,"eps":3.54776,"eps_lo":2.94,"eps_hi":3.86329,"eps_g":0.354}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"금광","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":1148033000.0,"operating_incom